    "name": "Demo – Operation Levante (tracking a fugitive)",
    "description": "Fictional scenario made for demonstration. People, accounts, organizations, domains (`.example`), IPs (documentation range), phone number (range reserved for fiction by the French regulator ARCEP) and wallet are made up.\n\nDamien Verlac absconded from court supervision on 12 March 2026. Starting from the wanted notice alone, the chain of pivots leads from France to Tarifa (Spain):\n\n1. wanted notice, then motorbike forum (email, handle);\n2. sale listing, then a BTC address reused on a Telegram channel;\n3. Instagram account, then a geolocated photo (beach, van, school);\n4. the school's website, then the instructor \"Dani V.\";\n5. close circle (partner), then presumed lodging;\n6. handover to the authorities.",
